e the given information $\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}=\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{4},$ and solve for $\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & =\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}\\cdot (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})) \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & =\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t} & =-\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t} & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339612 1017 #edb/ref 17592186339613 13194139535244 true] [17592186339612 1089 "q-115772" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339612 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535244 true] [17592186339612 1100 "Given that $r=\\theta +6\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ for $\\theta =\\theta (t),$ and that $\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}=7$ at the point where $\\theta =\\frac{7\\pi }{6},$ find $\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}.$" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339612 1113 #uuid "07059242-b72a-57d2-8e08-c5ac22ad9ca0" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339612 1145 "Differentiating the given relation with respect to $t$ using implicit differentiation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\theta +6\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(r) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\theta +6\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\theta +6\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}\\cdot (1-6\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we can substitute the given information $\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}=7$ and $\\theta =\\frac{7\\pi }{6},$ and solve for $\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}\\theta }{\\text{d}t}\\cdot (1-6\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =7\\cdot (1-6\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{6})) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =7\\cdot 4 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =28.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339614 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339615 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339616 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339617 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339618 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1041 "selection" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1104 #edb/ref 17592186339614 13194139535244 true] [17592186339613 1110 #uuid "97c3bf96-63b2-5aa8-9683-0fa684cb6e5d" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339614 1034 "28" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339614 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535244 true] [17592186339614 1111 #uuid "56b42973-0fe8-58b6-a0d2-f87bbec1125e" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339615 1034 "26" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339615 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535244 true] [17592186339615 1111 #uuid "a7371119-d489-5eb2-a7bd-e7770407dcd0" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339616 1034 "21" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339616 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535244 true] [17592186339616 1111 #uuid "76919b84-1c89-5413-a8b5-b7465f4b6dc1" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339617 1034 "32" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339617 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535244 true] [17592186339617 1111 #uuid "6c3ac0c4-9e87-5aee-bfdc-4133d83a554e" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339618 1034 "24" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339618 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535244 true] [17592186339618 1111 #uuid "72e1ecce-730b-5d03-a7fb-25bd400fbae2" 13194139535244 true] [17592186339619 1017 #edb/ref 17592186339620 13194139535244 true] [1759218633